{
  "headline": "FDA's records show quetiapine fumarate is not on the shortage list as of 2026-10-21; supply traces to Aurobindo Pharma Limited (FEI 3004021229) with an OAI inspection in 2010 and a VAI inspection on 2023-07-21",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "E11", "E3", "E10"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include quetiapine fumarate as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Both Corvale East and Corvale General stock the same NDC 65862049101 labeled by Aurobindo Pharma Limited.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label identifies the manufacturing plant as Aurobindo Pharma Limited (FEI 3004021229) in India, registered for analysis and manufacture.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for that FEI show an OAI classification from an inspection ending 2010-09-24 and a most recent VAI classification from an inspection ending 2023-07-21.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 45 tablets on hand at 7.8 tablets per day, giving 5.7 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General has 204 tablets on hand at 8.4 tablets per day, giving 24.4 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to transfer 65 tablets of 100 mg from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would leave Corvale General with two weeks of supply and bring Corvale East to 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
